  "summary": "Burford Capital CEO Christopher Bogart appears on “The Close” on Bloomberg TV, where he discusses the value of legal finance for businesses and the strong demand for Burford’s services. Bogart also highlights how legal finance is a wholly uncorrelated asset class, making it particularly valuable during periods of economic uncertainty. Learn more.",
